@model OrganizationExample15.Models.MPaciente
@Html.TextBoxFor(x=>x.Nombre, new { @class="_mpaciente", placeholder="Buscar" })@Html.TextBoxFor(x=>x.Id, new { @class="hidet" })
<script>
    $(function () {
        var options = $.extend(window._mpacienteoptions || {}, {
            queryURL: rootPath + "webservices/servicios.asmx/GetPacienteI",
            controlDataId: $("._mpaciente").next("input").attr("id"),
            displayName: "item",
            data: { e: '@ViewBag.User["entidades"]' },
            idField: "value"
        });
        $("._mpaciente").THAutoComplete(options);
    });
</script>
